---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config';

const title = 'Cookie Policy: No Cookies, Only Cookieless Clarity';
const description = "Cookie policy: this Italian net salary site sets no cookies and keeps nothing you type. Only an anonymous technical stability check with cookieless Clarity.";
const lastUpdated = '6 October 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
        Cookie Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Information on cookie usage pursuant to the Italian Data Protection Authority Guidelines of 10 June 2021
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:text-gray-900 dark:prose-headings:text-white">

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        A cookie is a small file a website stores on a computer or phone in order to recognise the visitor next time. The cookie guidelines of the <a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Garante per la Protezione dei Dati Personali</a> (Italian Data Protection Authority, measure of 10 June 2021) and Article 122 of Legislative Decree 196/2003 require sites to disclose any they use.
      </p>

      <h2>2. This Website Sets No Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>{SITE.name} sets no cookies at all</strong>: no technical, preference, analytics, profiling or third-party cookies. Nothing is written to your browser's <code>localStorage</code> or <code>sessionStorage</code> either. That is why there is no cookie banner: there is nothing to accept or decline.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Italian net salary, IRPEF, TFR, thirteenth-month and mortgage calculators work inside your browser. The gross annual salary (RAL), region, dependent children or number of monthly payments you enter never reach a server and are discarded when you close the tab; nothing remains on your device and the publisher records no personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Anonymous Stability Measurement: Microsoft Clarity Without Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        To spot technical problems (JavaScript errors, slow loading, clicks with no effect, scrolling trouble on mobile) we use <strong>Microsoft Clarity in cookieless mode</strong>. Before the script loads, the page tells Clarity that storage is denied: the cookies <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> and <code>CLID</code> are never created, each page view gets a fresh identifier and visits are not linked to one another. Page text and whatever you type in the fields are masked in your browser before anything is sent.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Controller for this measurement:</strong> Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland (<a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft privacy statement</a>).</li>
        <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> technical stability and performance of the Website only.</li>
        <li><strong>How long Microsoft keeps it:</strong> recordings for one month (30 days), aggregated statistics for up to thirteen months.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal basis:</strong> legitimate interest (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR) in calculators that work.</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> block the <code>clarity.ms</code> domain in your browser or with a blocking extension, or write to us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not use Google Analytics, advertising, social-media pixels or any other tracking tool.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Hosting Logs</h2>
      <p>
        Like any web server, the one run by our host (OVH SAS, Roubaix, France) automatically logs IP address, date and requested page for security purposes. These logs involve no cookie.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Legal References</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Regulation (EU) 2016/679</strong> (GDPR)</li>
        <li><strong>Legislative Decree No. 196 of 30 June 2003</strong> (Privacy Code), as amended by Legislative Decree 101/2018, in particular Article 122</li>
        <li><strong>Directive 2002/58/EC</strong> (ePrivacy Directive)</li>
        <li><strong>Cookie and other tracking tool guidelines</strong> of the Garante (measure of 10 June 2021, doc. web No. 9677876)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You may lodge a complaint with the Garante per la Protezione dei Dati Personali (<a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.garanteprivacy.it</a>).
      </p>

      <h2>6. Updates</h2>
      <p>
        Should the way the Website works ever change, this page and its date will be updated before the change takes effect.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any question, clarification or report relating to this Cookie Policy or the technical stability measurement, users may contact the owner via the <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a> of the Website. The owner undertakes to respond as quickly as possible.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        See also: <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="/en/legal-notice/">Legal Notice</a> | <a href="/en/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
